GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassCarrieIntro::
	.string "Don’t think I’m a pushover!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassCarrieDefeat::
	.string "Darn... I thought you were weak...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassCarrie::
	.string "In the world of POKéMON, I wonder\n"
	.string "what’s stronger: male or female?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautyVictoriaIntro::
	.string "Oh, you are a cute little trainer!\p"
	.string "I like you, but I won’t hold back!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautyVictoriaDefeat::
	.string "Let’s see... Oops, it’s over?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautyVictoria::
	.string "Wow, you must be good to beat me!\n"
	.string "Keep it up!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassBridgetIntro::
	.string "I like cute POKéMON better than\n"
	.string "strong POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But I have strong and cute POKéMON!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassBridgetDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no, no, no!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_LassBridget::
	.string "I’m trying to beat WHITNEY, but...\n"
	.string "It’s depressing.\p"
	.string "I’m okay! If I lose, I’ll just\n"
	.string "try harder next time!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautySamanthaIntro::
	.string "Give it your best shot, or I’ll take\n"
	.string "you down!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautySamanthaDefeat::
	.string "No! Oh, MEOWTH, I’m so sorry!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_BeautySamantha::
	.string "I taught MEOWTH moves for taking\n"
	.string "on any type...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirlIntro::
	.string "Hi! I’m WHITNEY!\p"
	.string "Everyone was into POKéMON, so I got\n"
	.string "into it too!\p"
	.string "POKéMON are super-cute!\p"
	.string "You want to battle? I’m warning\n"
	.string "you--I’m good!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirlDefeat::
	.string "Sob...\p"
	.string "...Waaaaaaah!\n"
	.string "You’re mean!\p"
	.string "You shouldn’t be so serious! You,\n"
	.string "you, child, you!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_1::
	.string "Waaaaah!\p"
	.string "Waaaaah!\p"
	.string "...Snivel, hic...\n"
	.string "...You meanie!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_2::
	.string "Ah, that was a good cry!\p"
	.string "Come for a visit again! Bye-bye!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_3::
	.string "...Sniff...\p"
	.string "What? What do you want? A BADGE?\p"
	.string "Oh, right. I forgot. Here’s\n"
	.string "PLAINBADGE.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_4::
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the PLAINBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_5::
	.string "PLAINBADGE lets your POKéMON use\n"
	.string "STRENGTH outside of battle.\p"
	.string "It also boosts your POKéMON’s\n"
	.string "SPEED.\p"
	.string "Oh, you can have this too!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_CrushGirl_6::
	.string "It’s ATTRACT!\n"
	.string "It makes full use of a\l"
	.string "POKéMON’s charm.\p"
	.string "Isn’t it just perfect for a cutie\n"
	.string "like me?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\p"
	.string "This GYM is home to normal-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON trainers.\p"
	.string "I recommend you use fighting-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "You won? Great! I was busy admiring\n"
	.string "the ladies here.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_Trigger::
	.string "Oh, no. You made WHITNEY cry.\p"
	.string "It’s OK. She’ll stop soon. She\n"
	.string "always cries when she loses.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "GOLDENROD CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: WHITNEY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "GOLDENROD CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: WHITNEY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER} CARLOS$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior16_Text_Sign1_3::
	.string "GOLDENROD CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: WHITNEY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
